.TITLE "sw_vers"

.DIV "DESCRIPTION"
Displays the macOS version information. It provides the product name, version number, and build version of the currently running operating system.

.DIV "TLDR"
**sw_vers**
Displays the full version information including Product Name, Product Version, and Build Version.
> 

**sw_vers -productVersion**
Prints only the macOS version number (e.g., 14.2.1).
> __-productVersion__ version only flag

.DIV "SUMMARY"
The __sw_vers__ command is often used in scripts to verify OS compatibility before executing platform-specific commands.

.DIV "SEE ALSO"
**linux:uname**

